{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38917","headline":"戏题王处士书斋 · 杜荀鹤","name":"戏题王处士书斋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"先生高兴似樵渔，水鸟山猿一处居。\n石径可行苔色厚，钓竿时斫竹丛疎。\n欺春祗爱和醅酒，讳老犹看夹注书。\n莫道无金空有寿，有金无寿欲何如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38917.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38917","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}